cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use CP²N², please cite the archived software release below."
title: "CP²N² — Control Plane for Physical Neural Networks"
abstract: >-
  CP²N² is a substrate-neutral control plane for discovering, admitting,
  selecting, leasing, invoking, validating, recovering, and auditing
  heterogeneous physical neural network resources through constrained
  agent-facing interfaces.
